      <description>The Democratic professional political class isn’t too happy with Texas Congresswoman Jasmine Crockett. After weeks of speculation, Crockett has made clear that she has no plans to campaign with James Talarico, the Democratic nominee in the Texas Senate race and the candidate who defeated her in the March primary.</description>
